# EmailJS configuration for the Contact form (Contact.jsx)
# Free tier: https://www.emailjs.com — 200 emails/month, no backend needed.
#
# Setup:
# 1. Sign up at https://dashboard.emailjs.com/sign-up
# 2. Email Services -> Add New Service -> connect Gmail (or your provider) -> copy the Service ID
# 3. Email Templates -> Create New Template -> use variables: {{from_name}} {{from_email}} {{reply_to}} {{to_name}} {{message}}
#    Set the template's "To email" to your own inbox, and "Reply To" to {{reply_to}}
#    Copy the Template ID
# 4. Account -> General -> copy your Public Key
# 5. Copy this file to ".env" in the project root and fill in the three values below
# 6. Restart `npm run dev` after editing .env (Vite only reads env vars at startup)
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_tbtycnd
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=template_ihrgrfj
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=SzjR_Y0Jsy4kMjetF
